      "name": "Combat Grab",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The ruffian has one hand free\n\n---\nEffect The ruffian makes a melee Strike while keeping one hand free. If this Strike hits, the ruffian Grabs the target using their free hand. The creature remains Grabbed until the end of the ruffian's next turn or until it Escapes, whichever comes first."
